Feature: Epic 109 VRA Economic Analysis & Optimization
  As a Farm Owner or Financial Controller
  I want cost-benefit analysis and dynamic economic threshold optimization for VRA
  So that I can maximize the return on investment for precision agricultural technologies

  @US-109-01 @Finance @ROI
  Scenario: Automated VRA cost-benefit analysis and ROI calculation
    Given a completed VRA production cycle
    When the financial engine compares VRA input usage against traditional methods
    Then it must automatically calculate the fertilizer/chemical savings
    And provide an ROI report based on the actual yield improvement and input cost reduction

  @US-109-02 @Market @Economics
  Scenario: Dynamic economic threshold optimization based on market prices
    Given real-time market prices for fertilizers and products
    When the system runs the "Economic S88" model
    Then it must automatically adjust the VRA decision thresholds to maintain profitability
    And suggest a "Conservative vs Aggressive" application strategy based on current commodity futures
